<title>HONG KONG: Top Form posts loss in 1995/96 year net.</title>
<headline>Top Form posts loss in 1995/96 year net.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   52.9 loss   vs 3.0 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  228.59 loss vs 6.39 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    353.02 loss vs 19.84 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     981.85	vs 1,049.65</p>
<p>    Company name		 Top Form International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  December 23-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Top Form International makes underwear.</p>
<p>The exceptional items in 1996 are principally in connection with core operations of the group of HK$114.28 million, property interest of the group of HK$55.65 million, retail operations in Taiwan of HK$51.17 million and restructuring costs of HK$7.50 million.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs one Hong Kong cent.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
